  "question": {
    "text": "If the image of the point&nbsp;<math><mi>M</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>,</mo><msup><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;on the line <math><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math> is <math><mi>N</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0,2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>, then the sum of the square of all the possible values of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>λ</mi></math> is equal to"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math><mn>5</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mn>2</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mn>1</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mn>4</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "A"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Since the mid-point of the line segment&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>M</mi><mi>N</mi></math>&nbsp;lie on the given line,</p><p>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mi>&#955;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>&#955;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>&#955;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mfenced></math></p><p>Also, the line segment&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>M</mi><mi>N</mi></math>&nbsp;is perpendicular to the given line<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>&#955;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mo>&#215;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><img src=\"assets\\st0086_2f6d6e6e0c9d.png\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" style=\"width:1.8in;height:1.61319in\" /><br />As <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> and <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> must be satisfied simultaneously,<br /><math><mo>&#8756;</mo></math> On solving, we get,</p><p>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1,2</mn><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"/><mo>&#8658;</mo><msubsup><mi>&#955;</mi><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>&#955;</mi><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></math></p>"
  }
}